1
00:00:00,053 --> 00:00:06,055
Work needs context, not just a status.

2
00:00:06,181 --> 00:00:16,184
Keep the original requirements visible as work changes.

3
00:00:16,216 --> 00:00:24,218
Each requirement retains its supporting source text.

4
00:00:24,259 --> 00:00:34,261
The exporter was built. Delivery is still unresolved.

5
00:00:34,379 --> 00:00:42,380
Read the source before treating a report as proof.

6
00:00:42,701 --> 00:00:50,703
Keep shared context and its change history in one workspace.

7
00:00:50,748 --> 00:00:58,749
An enrolled agent reads the same work through scoped MCP access.

8
00:00:58,805 --> 00:01:05,807
Panini is open source. Start at github.com/sk1122/panini
